with weaker kickers, weak pairs (9s, maybe even 4s or 2s if opponent is stubborn), and potential bluff-catchers to call. It's large enough to build the pot but not so large that I only get called by better hands. Given opponent's passive line, they likely have a marginal hand that might call a reasonable bet but would fold to an all-in.\n\nAnswer: 750"}
