ent.\n\nReason:\n\nI'll make a modest value bet of 400. Here's why:\n- My two pair (10s and 3s) is decent but vulnerable to any Ace\n- Opponent's passive calling suggests a marginal hand, not a monster\n- A bet of 400 is large enough to extract value from weaker pairs or a Queen, but not so large that I'm overcommitting if they have an Ace\n- If opponent has been slowplaying a huge hand, a smaller bet limits my losses\n- Checking gives up value against hands like 99, 88, KQ, QJ, or missed draws\n\nAnswer: 400"}
