lled by better hands\n- Worse hands will fold\n- The board is very coordinated for straights\n\nSince I'm already ahead in the overall match (+6,000 chips cumulative) and this is a marginal spot, **checking** is the prudent play. I preserve my showdown value without risking chips in a spot where I'm unlikely to get value from worse hands.\n\n**Answer:** 0"}
